" class="sc-iKOmoZ sc-cCzLxZ WVNwY VEBGS"><h4 id="profile">Profile</h4>
                                <p>This collection provides API endpoints for users to access and manage their own profile information. Users can retrieve their profile data, update specific details, change their password, and update their profile picture.</p>
                                <h4 id="endpoint-description">Endpoint Description</h4>
                                <p>This endpoint allows authorized users to update their password. Users can submit a new password through this endpoint to enhance their account security.</p>
                                <h4 id="payload">Payload</h4>
                                <table>
                                    <thead>
                                    <tr>
