 profiles or branding purposes\n  \n#### Parameters\n\n| **Key** | **Description** |\n| --- | --- |\n| /api/v1/users/:id | ID of the user |\n\n#### Payload\n\n| **Key** | **Validation** |\n| --- | --- |\n| photo | Maxed size of 5MB, required, valid image format |","tags":["Users"],"parameters":[],"requestBody":{"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"photo":{"example":[],"type":"string","format":"binary"}},"required":["photo"]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"success":{"type":"boolean"},"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"owner_id":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string"}},"required":["owner_id","path","url"]}},"required":["success","data"]},"examples":{"1":{"summary":"Success","value":{"success":true,"data":{"owner_id":"7","path":"images/7/profile-pictures/test.png","url":"https://valid-url.png"}}}}}}}},"security":[]}},"/api/v1/users/search":{"get":{"summary":"Search Users","deprecated":false,"description":"#### Users\nThis collection provides functionalities for authorized `administrators` and `super users` to manage user data within the system. These functionalities include retrieving detailed information about specific users, updating user profiles, creating new user accounts, and soft-deleting users (deactivating accounts while preserving data). Additionally, `administrators` and `super users` can search for users by name or email and retrieve paginated user lists for efficient browsing of large datasets.\n\n#### Endpoint Description\n\nSearch for users based on their name or email address. This functionality facilitates efficient identification and management of users\n\n#### Query Parameters\n\n| **key** | **description** |\n| --- | --- |\n| query | A string value that can be part of the user's name or email  <br>  <br>Example:  <br>  <br>`?query=Lastname   ?query=email-2` |","tags":["Users"],"parameters":[{"na